# Where the ARC Raiders catalog comes from

Everything here was read on **2026-10-10**. `catalog.json` is the single-kind
form (`kind: "weapons"`, Warzone's shape). ARC Raiders has **no characters or
classes**: a raider's look is cosmetic, and what he plays with is his loadout
(two weapon slots, an augment, a shield, quick-use items).

**Pictures:** the in-game item icons, see Pictures at the end (D474).

## What is in ARC Raiders today

- **Frozen Trail (the 2.0 update)**, live since 2026-10-08
  ([Embark's patch notes](https://www.arcraiders.com/news/frozen-trail-2-0-update)).
  It added the **Stiletto** (battle rifle) and the **Bantam** ("the uncommon
  hand cannon"), changed the Anvil's rarity "from Green to Blue", and added
  Amplified Weapons, a fifth quality level for 15 weapons
  ([content preview, 2026-09-23](https://www.arcraiders.com/news/frozen-trail-content-preview)).
- **26 weapons in 9 classes**, from the community [ARC Raiders wiki's weapon
  table](https://arcraiders.wiki/wiki/Weapons) (last edited 2026-10-09; Embark
  publishes no weapon list). Every name, class and fire mode in the catalog
  matches that table, checked 2026-10-10.
- Guns added after launch, with where `from` comes from:

