|---|---|---|
| Aphelion | North Line (1.2.0), 2025-11-13 | wiki history "Added to the game" under 1.2.0; Embark's [1.2.0 notes](https://arcraiders.com/news/north-line-patch-notes) do **not** name it, so the item is `uncertain` |
